<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="667921839"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:40.840"><div begin="37.926" end="1:00.055" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="37.926" end="42.035" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.926" end="38.609">谁又</span><span begin="38.609" end="38.847">骑</span><span begin="38.847" end="39.339">着</span><span begin="39.339" end="39.891">那</span><span begin="39.891" end="40.351">鹿车</span><span begin="40.351" end="40.923">飞</span><span begin="40.923" end="42.035">过</span></p><p begin="44.154" end="48.314" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.154" end="44.522">忘</span><span begin="44.522" end="44.724">掉</span><span begin="44.724" end="45.001">投</span><span begin="45.001" end="45.532">下</span><span begin="45.532" end="46.048">那</span><span begin="46.048" end="46.279">礼</span><span begin="46.279" end="46.522">物</span><span begin="46.522" end="47.064">给</span><span begin="47.064" end="48.314">我</span></p><p begin="50.307" end="55.558" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.307" end="50.901">凝视</span><span begin="50.901" end="51.158">那</span><span begin="51.158" end="51.570">灯</span><span begin="51.570" end="52.124">饰</span><span begin="52.124" end="52.620">只有</span><span begin="52.620" end="53.183">今</span><span begin="53.183" end="53.664">晚</span><span begin="53.664" end="53.913">最</span><span begin="53.913" end="54.191">光</span><span begin="54.191" end="54.741">最</span><span begin="54.741" end="55.558">亮</span></p><p begin="56.463" end="1:00.055" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.463" end="57.315">却照亮</span><span begin="57.315" end="57.802">我</span><span begin="57.802" end="58.309">的</span><span begin="58.309" end="58.884">寂</span><span begin="58.884" end="1:00.055">寞</span></p></div><div begin="1:02.591" end="1:25.212" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:02.591" end="1:06.712" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.591" end="1:02.984">谁</span><span begin="1:02.984" end="1:03.430">又能</span><span beg